      "message": "SAPEnqueue: Added SAP Enqueue Server as main dissector\n\nAdded the SAP Enqueue (Enqueue Server) dissector protocol from [SecureAuth's plugin](https://github.com/SecureAuthCorp/SAP-Dissection-plug-in-for-Wireshark/blob/master/src/packet-sapenqueue.c).\n\nThis is a simple dissector for the Enqueue protocol. Some details and example requests can be found in [pysap's documentation](https://pysap.readthedocs.io/en/latest/protocols/SAPEnqueue.html).\n",
